	(gr_text "Build Notes:\nDiodes, MCU, & Resistors all surface-mount to this side of the PCB (bottom).\nLEDs should be surface-mounted to the top side. Install LEDs before adding switches.\nMCU Footprint for RP2040 Community MCUs (Helios, Frood42, Splinky etc). NOT COMPATIBLE WITH ELITE C"
